{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"w":0.30609931945800783,"h":0.03552447518767865,"t":"@MirsIELTS","c":1,"y":0.0054935763474011079,"x":0.0060879171725284923},{"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.087905952086767672,"h":0.015915909488644187,"w":0.12188981374104817,"c":1,"y":0.04568235384145436},{"c":1,"w":0.72689936319986981,"h":0.013274336283185861,"y":0.092920353809830658,"x":0.090349086235526191,"t":"As far as the tardigrade's head is concerned, the best way I can describe this is that it looks"},{"w":0.71457906087239587,"c":1,"t":"rather strange - a bit squashed even - though many of the websites I looked at described","y":0.10901162773518136,"x":0.088295685067780127,"h":0.011637339971761751},{"w":0.71472813924153644,"c":1,"h":0.017522541259945679,"x":0.08820886647014968,"y":0.12206418401640495,"t":"its appearance as cute, which isn't exactly very scientific. The tardigrade's mouth is a kind"},{"h":0.014563181266672109,"x":0.090349085990137037,"c":1,"t":"of tube that can open outwards to reveal teeth-like structures known as 'stylets'. These are","y":0.13805309759132656,"w":0.71868581136067711},{"y":0.15250737460951491,"x":0.090349078343448311,"c":1,"t":"sharp enough to pierce plant or animal cells.","w":0.35523612976074226,"h":0.01327433628318575},{"h":0.016070693362075672,"y":0.17433628326139872,"x":0.08829568581722716,"c":1,"w":0.73921971638997397,"t":"So, where are tardigrades found? Well, they live in every part of the world, in a variety of habitats:"},{"w":0.71047225952148441,"x":0.090349085682362704,"t":"most commonly, on the bed of a lake, or on many kinds of plants or in very wet environments.","h":0.013274336283185861,"c":1,"y":0.19026548665700249},{"c":1,"t":"There's been some interesting research which has found that tardigrades are capable of surviving","y":0.2035001164644874,"x":0.088216463143312468,"w":0.74347635904947917,"h":0.017465233029165805},{"h":0.017681098195303835,"x":0.086181674025239657,"w":0.70237528483072909,"t":"radiation and very high pressure, and they're also able to withstand temperatures as cold as","y":0.21904932109437592,"c":1},{"y":0.23539822987529613,"h":0.014601769911504414,"c":1,"x":0.088295679081238532,"w":0.72895278930664054,"t":"-200 degrees centigrade, or highs of more than 148 degrees centigrade, which is incredibly hot."},{"h":0.014579038141751322,"y":0.27475356446900412,"x":0.090281451022720768,"w":0.7044375610351562,"c":1,"t":"It has been said that tardigrades could survive long after human beings have been wiped"},{"t":"out, even in the event of an asteroid hitting the earth. If conditions become too extreme and","y":0.29056047220868675,"w":0.72279261271158857,"c":1,"x":0.090349073352258724,"h":0.013274336283185972},{"h":0.017193878083805902,"c":1,"x":0.08618361675320188,"t":"tardigrades are at risk of drying out, they enter a state called cryptobiosis. They curl into a","y":0.30505759076213046,"w":0.71469924926757811},{"x":0.088143534342898039,"h":0.019900206619307803,"w":0.70049636840820317,"c":1,"y":0.31837471183424737,"t":"ball, called a tun - that's T-U-N - by retracting their head and legs, and their metabolism"},{"y":0.33569321533599661,"c":1,"t":"drops to less than one percent of normal levels. They can remain like this until they are","x":0.088295684247413908,"w":0.68993840535481765,"h":0.016050970589516655},{"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"re-introduced to water, when they will come back to life in a matter of a few hours. While in a","x":0.088295692011577012,"y":0.35162241873317246,"w":0.73305953979492178,"c":1},{"w":0.74344980875651046,"t":"state of cryptobiosis, tardigrades produce a protein that protects their DNA. In 2016, scientists","x":0.08823111538467808,"h":0.01672020802455676,"c":1,"y":0.36576882586711812},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"x":0.086242297501446408,"y":0.38226744206768815,"w":0.73100616455078127,"c":1,"t":"revived two tardigrades that had been tuns for more than 30 years. There was a report that,"},{"t":"in 1948, a 120-year-old tun was revived, but this experiment has never been repeated. There","h":0.013274336283185972,"y":0.3967551620413432,"w":0.73716634114583335,"c":1,"x":0.090349067379197831},{"c":1,"w":0.73522888183593749,"t":"are currently several tests taking place in space, to determine how long tardigrades might be","x":0.088239646596091653,"y":0.41112959993929432,"h":0.017021804291941778},{"w":0.46836771647135417,"c":1,"x":0.088209069730649403,"t":"able to survive there. I believe the record so far is 10 days.","h":0.016183644972719513,"y":0.42577840574083226},{"c":1,"h":0.019092087197092877,"x":0.088176614856574062,"y":0.44635232761492405,"t":"So, erm, moving on. In terms of their diet, tardigrades consume liquids in order to survive.","w":0.7127728780110677},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"x":0.088295690364437296,"y":0.46366279090312146,"w":0.68377822875976557,"t":"Although they have teeth, they don't use these for chewing. They suck the juices from","c":1},{"y":0.47775361145711881,"x":0.088253484414490227,"w":0.73314498901367187,"h":0.015216092585110808,"c":1,"t":"moss, or extract fluid from seaweed, but some species prey on other tardigrades, from other"},{"x":0.086242303647996441,"w":0.72484598795572919,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"y":0.49410029479948858,"t":"species or within their own. I suppose this isn't surprising, given that tardigrades are mainly"},{"h":0.015727483698751987,"c":1,"y":0.50796929903342258,"x":0.086144924245467533,"t":"comprised of liquid and are coated with a type of gel.","w":0.42526326497395822},{"t":"Finally, I'd like to mention the conservation status of tardigrades. It is estimated that they have","x":0.088236928169121612,"y":0.5289761524473221,"h":0.016719527793141564,"w":0.74343536376953123,"c":1},{"x":0.086242310032069822,"t":"been in existence for approximately half a billion years and, in that time, they have survived","w":0.72689936319986981,"h":0.016003807315432494,"y":0.54505813964922922,"c":1},{"x":0.08616392307887992,"w":0.72293512980143237,"h":0.017857045198963806,"y":0.55920084091682476,"t":"five mass extinctions. So, it will probably come as no surprise to you, that tardigrades have","c":1},{"x":0.086201518172848449,"w":0.73522171020507809,"h":0.015868840738032075,"c":1,"y":0.57428228169398765,"t":"not been evaluated by the International Union for Conservation of Nature and are not on any"},{"y":0.58884411001758907,"x":0.086146544517225726,"w":0.54849095662434899,"c":1,"t":"endangered list. Some researchers have described them as thriving.","h":0.017362248018428006},{"t":"Does anyone have any questions they'd like to ask?","w":0.41478439331054695,"x":0.088295688251813359,"y":0.61179941019598327,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.1250000001374294,"w":0.03696098327636721,"t":"Q35","x":0.8583162231462107,"h":0.013081394746943475},{"y":0.22383720955966768,"w":0.036960986455281564,"t":"Q36","x":0.85831622125558982,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1},{"t":"Q37","w":0.039014374415079711,"x":0.85626283322367158,"h":0.013081394746943587,"y":0.36773255840200703,"c":1},{"t":"Q38","x":0.85626283322367158,"w":0.039014374415079711,"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"y":0.41569767421430459},{"c":1,"t":"Q39","y":0.46511627932710953,"w":0.036960986455281564,"x":0.85626283317893015,"h":0.013081394746943698},{"t":"Q40","x":0.85626283316443541,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943475,"y":0.56250000026247216},{"t":"TEST 3","h":0.017488166223936785,"c":1,"w":0.10266940434773758,"y":0.66569767441985694,"x":0.40862422992352049},{"c":1,"t":"PART 1","x":0.088295687804062439,"y":0.72819767461281848,"w":0.10061601638793946,"h":0.014575186872904267},{"t":"LEON:","w":0.043301957448323561,"h":0.0091800284596671444,"c":1,"y":0.75703789265730137,"x":0.088205284333503733},{"t":"SHANNON:","c":1,"x":0.088239436001162852,"y":0.77305283483070297,"w":0.071981086730957017,"h":0.010580376819171788},{"y":0.78905000444550222,"t":"LEON:","c":1,"x":0.086169030334861604,"w":0.045321076711018884,"h":0.0091092933947357624},{"t":"SHANNON:","h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1,"w":0.071868578592936216,"y":0.80377906956175382,"x":0.088295690862669474},{"w":0.045174538294474278,"t":"LEON:","y":0.8357558138507557,"h":0.010174418761666804,"x":0.086242299543483517,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1,"y":0.86627906958718981,"w":0.071868578592936203,"t":"SHANNON:","x":0.088295690682998015},{"w":0.045174538294474278,"c":1,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"x":0.086242299543483517,"t":"LEON:","y":0.88226744185278561},{"x":0.088295686888067215,"w":0.07186858495076498,"y":0.89825581395411458,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"t":"SHANNON:","c":1},{"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"x":0.088295687361802377,"y":0.92005813979735585,"t":"108","h":0.013081394746943587},{"t":"Hi Shannon - how are you settling into your new flat?","h":0.016711130958039444,"x":0.18470462369948573,"y":0.75569223837880029,"w":0.42522687276204429,"c":1},{"y":0.77168141618667763,"w":0.15811088562011719,"c":1,"t":"Really well, thanks.","x":0.18480492661645945,"h":0.014749262536873142},{"h":0.013094258378740564,"t":"You look like you're going shopping.","x":0.18685831251280235,"y":0.78779069740672525,"w":0.28747433980305992,"c":1},{"w":0.64281906127929678,"y":0.80230192471796313,"t":"Yes, I am. My cousins are coming to stay for a couple of days, and I have to cook","c":1,"x":0.18679658042104336,"h":0.016376535871387654},{"c":1,"w":0.076500352223714208,"t":"for them.","x":0.18253600111927137,"y":0.81816210697839098,"h":0.011324216904541773},{"t":"Well, there are plenty of places to buy food in Kite Place - it's the area by","c":1,"y":0.83421828888570193,"x":0.1848049210789954,"w":0.58316223144531254,"h":0.013274336283185861},{"y":0.84969073320310073,"w":0.10115248998006185,"c":1,"x":0.18247797830389004,"t":"the harbour.","h":0.013084111171486112},{"y":0.86482558159985801,"t":"Oh, OK, I'll find that on the map. Thanks.","x":0.18275153766270591,"c":1,"h":0.014534883302221635,"w":0.32854209899902342},{"t":"What sort of food do you need to get?","x":0.18480492497385645,"y":0.88081395322219935,"w":0.30390144348144532,"h":0.013081395872223012,"c":1},{"y":0.89528247290853147,"c":1,"t":"Well, neither of them eats meat but they both like fish.","x":0.18263778402025882,"w":0.43141886393229162,"h":0.018932090466704632},{"x":0.85215605851139231,"w":0.028747431437174509,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"Q1","y":0.84883720943975505,"c":1},{"y":0.94166666659226195,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.45294118245442705,"c":1,"h":0.04166666666666663,"x":0.51176470218665204}]}